      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook bacon in a large skillet over medium heat until browned and crisp. Remove to paper towels. Pour olive oil into skillet, and stir in garlic and asparagus. Cook, stirring, until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
